    "text": "<p>Among the statements:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
